OL,5,G0505 Ainsley's Taste of the Bahamas
OL,6,     FAinsley Harriott explores Bahamian
OL,7,     Fbreakfasts, starting with coffee
OL,8,     Fand a morning fish dish at a
OL,9,     Fbeachside shack. Then he takes in
OL,10,     Fsome undersea art at Clifton
OL,11,     FHeritage Park, before plating up a
OL,12,     Fplantain and sweet potato rosti
OL,13,     Fwith crab salad
